{"seq":6,"slug":"nursing","title":"中等职业教育护理学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"中等职业教育护理学\">中等职业教育护理学</h1><p>我决定整理这套护理笔记，是因为身边一位中职护理专业的朋友总跟我抱怨：课本上写得密密麻麻，可真到了实训室拿起血压计、面对一张铺好的床单，反而手足无措。于是我想换一个角度——不把护理当成一门需要背诵的学科，而是当成一套可以一步步上手的&quot;动手活儿&quot;，从最基础的洗手、测体温讲起，慢慢走到给患者打针、照顾发烧的病人。</p>\n<p>护理这个职业在中国正变得越来越被需要。截至 2025 年底，全国注册护士总数达到 606.2 万人，每千人口注册护士数从 2020 年的 3.34 提升到 4.32。与此同时，&quot;互联网+护理服务&quot;也在落地——全国约 6000 家医疗机构提供母婴护理、老年照护、慢病管理、康复指导、安宁疗护等上门服务。这意味着中职护理学生毕业后的去向，已经不只是医院病房，社区、养老机构、居家护理都在招人。</p>\n<p>这套笔记面向的是刚入门的中职学生，所以我刻意把&quot;实操&quot;放在前面，把&quot;理论&quot;压到够用就好的程度。我们会先弄清楚护理到底是干什么的、护士每天的工作是什么样子；再扎扎实实练好基础护理技术，包括生命体征测量、无菌操作、注射给药、铺床与体位；接着用几种最常见的病（发烧、糖尿病、高血压、伤口）把技术串起来，看看护理在真实场景里怎么用；最后回到&quot;人&quot;本身，聊聊护理伦理和怎么跟患者好好说话。</p>\n<p>我希望读完之后，你不只是&quot;知道&quot;这些操作，而是能在脑子里走一遍流程：东西怎么摆、手怎么动、患者会有什么反应、出了状况怎么办。护理的核心从来不是记住多少条文，而是把规范变成肌肉记忆，再用一颗细心的心去对待每一个人。</p>\n<p>如果你是正在备考护士执业资格证、或者准备参加 1+X 证书考核的中职学生，这套笔记里的技术要点和操作流程也能帮你把零散的知识点串成一条清晰的主线。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-foundations-and-career","title":"护理基础与职业认知","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-foundations-and-career","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-nursing","title":"护理是什么","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-foundations-and-career/what-is-nursing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nurse-role-and-ethics-overview","title":"护士的角色与职业认知","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-foundations-and-career/nurse-role-and-ethics-overview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hospital-environment-and-ward","title":"医院环境与病区","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-foundations-and-career/hospital-environment-and-ward"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"basic-nursing-techniques","title":"基础护理技术","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/basic-nursing-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vital-signs-measurement","title":"生命体征测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/basic-nursing-techniques/vital-signs-measurement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aseptic-technique-and-handwashing","title":"无菌操作与手卫生","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/basic-nursing-techniques/aseptic-technique-and-handwashing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"injection-and-medication","title":"注射与给药","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/basic-nursing-techniques/injection-and-medication"},{"seq":4,"slug":"bedmaking-and-patient-positioning","title":"铺床与患者体位","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/basic-nursing-techniques/bedmaking-and-patient-positioning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"common-disease-care","title":"常见病护理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/common-disease-care","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fever-and-respiratory-care","title":"发热与呼吸系统护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/common-disease-care/fever-and-respiratory-care"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diabetes-and-hypertension-care","title":"糖尿病与高血压护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/common-disease-care/diabetes-and-hypertension-care"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wound-and-postop-care","title":"伤口与术后护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/common-disease-care/wound-and-postop-care"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"nursing-ethics-and-communication","title":"护理伦理与沟通","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-ethics-and-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-ethics-principles","title":"护理伦理原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-ethics-and-communication/nursing-ethics-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"patient-communication-skills","title":"护患沟通技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/nursing/nursing-ethics-and-communication/patient-communication-skills"}]}]}